  "description": "Zentrik gives Claude a product brain for your whole team. Grow learnings & evidence without context limits, inspect traceability of product decisions from the first call to delivery, evaluate priorities, and prepare requirements, prototypes and other assets from the same evidence and decisions.\n\nZentrik is a product-discovery system of action. It ingests customer evidence (calls, tickets, reviews, market data) as signals, distills them into insights, opportunities, ideas and initiatives, and keeps every decision traceable back to its source evidence and your objectives.\n\nProduct teams use this durable product context to decide what to build and to generate evidence-grounded work for engineering teams and coding agents.",
